# The quasi-TM mode is less confined: a lower index and a larger share of the field in the cladding.
# Reference: the same grid solved with a sparse eigen-solver in SciPy. Bounds: cladding index and TM slab index.
title Silicon strip 350 x 220 nm, quasi-TM
grid dx=0.025 dy=0.02
window width=3.0 ymin=-1.0 ymax=1.22
rect si -0.175 0.175 0 0.22
symmetry even
field tm
expect neff 1.756205927 2e-8
expect group_index 3.511527635 2e-6
expect confinement 0.158326963 1e-6
expect area 0.285731345 1e-5
expect guided yes
expect cells 6660
expect neff_between 1.444 2.053320
